WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
<v Dana, security desk>In January, we sent everyone a fake password reset.

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:09.840
<v Dana, security desk>Two in three opened it, one in three clicked, and one in twelve typed a password.

3
00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:13.979
<v Dana, security desk>And only one in seven told the security desk.
